      "competingExplanation": "None; this is a definition of service area and normal state.","evidenceGap":"No evidence that any change occurred in the supply path between 09:48 and 10:00. The gap is whether an unrecorded valve move or routing change happened upstream, which would explain P-R dropping while P-U remained stable."
    },
    {
      "fromKey": "n-1htojh2",
