      "claimIds": [],
      "counterfactual": "If the field execution record had documented a valve state or temporary instruction, it might explain how P-R dropped without upstream change.",
      "competingExplanation":"The blank record does not prove no work was done; it only proves lack of documentation. The competing explanation is that an undocumented action occurred.","evidenceGap": "No evidence of the actual field operation at 10:00, nor confirmation whether a valve move or routing change happened."
    },
    {
