      "status": "supported",
      "sourceIds": ["eaee59fe-70f4-4876-a21d-780814412078#1"],
      "claimIds": [],
      "counterfactual":"If the signature had been signed, it would indicate formal release and possibly documented valve states.","competingExplanation":"The lack of signature alone does not cause pressure loss; it indicates incomplete administrative closure. The competing explanation is that an undocumented physical change occurred despite pending acceptance.","evidenceGap": "No evidence linking the unsigned signature directly to a specific unrecorded action."
