      "rationale":"No line opening was authorized, suggesting that any interruption occurred without formal isolation procedure or documented change management.","status": "supported","sourceIds":["24ec1587-92e9-4320-82c2-30368d834f1d#1"],"claimIds":[],"counterfactual":"If a line opening had been authorized, it would be documented and explain the interruption.","competingExplanation": "The lack of authorization does not prove no action occurred; an undocumented change could still happen. The competing explanation is that an unrecorded valve move or routing change happened without formal approval.","evidenceGap": "No evidence of any field operation log showing a specific time when a valve was moved."
