      "rationale":"The area directory does not establish valve positions or pressure availability, meaning it cannot explain the cause of P-R dropping.","status": "supported","sourceIds":["b678a928-a8d2-472d-bc03-2e1a3dc411e6#1"],"claimIds":[],"counterfactual":"If the directory established valve positions, it could explain whether a specific valve was open or closed.","competingExplanation": "The inability of the directory to show valve states does not prove no change occurred; an undocumented action is possible. The competing explanation is that an unrecorded physical change happened.","evidenceGap": "No evidence from other sources (logs, drawings) showing actual valve positions at 10:00."
    },
