      "toKey": "n-1htojh2",
      "type": "caused",
      "rationale":"P-R dropped from normal to below alarm threshold, indicating a supply disturbance at the receiving end.","status": "supported","sourceIds":["fcd254db-75b3-4a9d-abec-44c5b6a9b34e#1"],"claimIds":[],"counterfactual":"If P-R had not dropped, no supply disturbance would have occurred at the receiving end.","competingExplanation": "The drop could be due to upstream change or distribution system issue; it does not prove a specific valve move. The competing explanation is that an unrecorded physical change happened.","evidenceGap": "No evidence of any field operation log showing a specific time when a valve was moved."
    },
